我的意思是，这应该成为该理论的一部分。

1143
00:54:50.220 --> 00:54:52.460
Part of the reason why he is not.
这也是他不是凶手的原因之一。

1144
00:54:52.960 --> 00:54:53.440
Yes.
对。

1145
00:54:53.660 --> 00:54:58.520
Is you have to break the fourth wall and say the writers wouldn't do that.
那就是你必须打破第四面墙，然后说编剧们不会那么做。

1146
00:54:59.260 --> 00:55:00.140
Well, okay.
好吧，行吧。

1147
00:55:00.220 --> 00:55:04.320
If you weren't breaking the fourth wall, then you would just say it's too unlikely.
如果你不打破第四面墙，你就会觉得这太不合常理了。

1148
00:55:04.540 --> 00:55:06.300
This is like an Occam's razor kind of thing.
这就有点像奥卡姆剃刀原理。

1149
00:55:06.300 --> 00:55:14.880
Like, no, the most likely thing is generally the truth, where the guy convicted is guilty of the thing.
就是说，不，最可能的情况通常就是真相，被定罪的那个人确实有罪。

1150
00:55:16.020 --> 00:55:17.520
You know, there was a trial.
你知道的，毕竟审判过。

1151
00:55:17.820 --> 00:55:24.940
But, yeah, if you're willing to break the fourth wall, and I've been thinking about this a lot over the last 24 hours of watching all those videos,
但是，对，如果你愿意打破第四堵墙，而且我在过去24小时看了所有那些视频之后一直在想这件事，

1152
00:55:25.180 --> 00:55:29.820
it's just, you know, we always search for, like, the thing that people were experiencing,
就是，你知道的，我们总是在寻找，比如，人们当时在经历的东西，

1153
00:55:29.820 --> 00:55:37.400
which sometimes is, like, a proximity to a big story, but not an actual part of it.
有时候就像是接近一个重大新闻，但并不是真正参与其中。

1154
00:55:38.300 --> 00:55:45.500
So I feel like that would have been something we would have probably pitched, broken, we would have had a version of it,
所以我觉得这可能是我们会提出、推敲过并做出过一个版本的点子，

1155
00:55:45.540 --> 00:55:48.260
and ultimately decided, like, no, this is not our show.
但最终会觉得，不对，这不是我们的节目。

1156
00:55:48.460 --> 00:55:48.800
Right.
对。

1157
00:55:48.940 --> 00:55:49.560
This is not.
这不是。

1158
00:55:49.740 --> 00:55:51.340
We're like, we shouldn't do this.
我们会觉得，我们不该这么做。

1159
00:55:51.440 --> 00:55:52.440
This is a jump.
这是一个跨度。

1160
00:55:52.440 --> 00:55:54.120
This would be a jumping the shark moment.
这会是一个江郎才尽（跳鲨鱼）的时刻。

1161
00:55:54.140 --> 00:55:54.640
Yeah, for sure.
对，肯定的。

1162
00:55:54.760 --> 00:55:59.420
If Dunder Mifflin had an employee that was a serial killer.
如果邓德米夫林有一个员工是个连环杀手。

1163
00:55:59.420 --> 00:55:59.880
Yes.
是的。

