George Howard Scubb.
乔治·霍华德·斯库布。

1169
00:56:16.060 --> 00:56:16.700
No one in the world.
世上没有人。

1170
00:56:16.700 --> 00:56:19.540
Is the Scranton Strangler, or was he wrongfully convicted?
是斯克兰顿扼杀者，还是说他被错误定罪了？

1171
00:56:19.540 --> 00:56:21.040
That maybe we don't know.
这个或许我们不得而知。

1172
00:56:21.240 --> 00:56:23.020
Is the Strangler still out there?
扼杀者还在逍遥法外吗？

1173
00:56:23.800 --> 00:56:25.180
That's a whole other question.
那是完全另外一个问题了。

1174
00:56:25.560 --> 00:56:26.340
Yeah, yeah.
对，对。

1175
00:56:26.340 --> 00:56:30.600
