对，这也是我在整个斯克兰顿想说的。

1204
00:57:39.780 --> 00:57:47.880
You know, there is some statistic, and I had it, but I don't have it with me now, that a lot of times crimes are committed nearest where people live.
你知道的，有个统计数据——我之前查过，不过现在没带在身上——很多时候犯罪都是在离人们居住地最近的地方发生的。

1205
00:57:48.300 --> 00:57:59.500
And that's why a lot of times when people commit a crime near, close to where they live or work, they do a much harder job at trying to hide it because it will,
这就是为什么很多时候，当人们在他们居住或工作地点附近犯罪时，他们会花更大的力气去试图掩盖，因为这会……

1206
00:57:59.700 --> 00:58:02.020
it's very close to their circle of where they live.
这离他们生活的圈子非常近。

1207
00:58:02.020 --> 00:58:11.900
So the fact that he drives down the street where his car is also parked, and while he's driving down the street of all of Scranton, that is where Dunder Mifflin is,
所以，他开车经过自己车停的那条街，而且在整个斯克兰顿偏偏开过邓德米弗林的所在地这条街，

1208
00:58:12.140 --> 00:58:24.440
